# The velocity drop under two definitions, 25x25x75, same instrument for both
# methods.  "raw" takes the global maximum of w and the minimum after it; "robust"
# locates the overshoot in t in [0.3,1.5] on a centred 5-point mean.  The last
# column is the frame-to-frame scatter of w about that mean, as a fraction of the
# peak -- it is what separates the two definitions.
